# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fav Fifty frontend (Vite) — environment template.
#
# Copy to frontend/.env.local (git-ignored) and fill in as needed. Vite loads
# env files from THIS folder (frontend/), not the repo root. Only VITE_-prefixed
# vars are exposed to the browser bundle, and ANYTHING in the bundle is public —
# never put a secret here.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local  # run from frontend/
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base path the SPA calls. Defaults to "/api" (proxied to the backend in dev by
# vite.config.ts), so you normally leave this unset locally.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
